WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:17.397
and Mandy stayed awhile to watch Seiko's parents dye the fabrics.

2
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:23.002
"I'll take you to Daimyo Masamune's home now," said Seiko.

3
00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:29.428
When they reached the daimyo's house, Seiko said good-bye at the front gate.

4
00:00:31.052 --> 00:00:34.954
"Thanks for everything," said Vinnie, pointing to his sandals.

5
00:00:34.974 --> 00:00:38.957
"Come and visit again," said Seiko.

6
00:00:40.158 --> 00:00:41.578
Then she bowed and left.

7
00:00:41.598 --> 00:00:45.701
"Do you think Haruki will be looking for us?"

8
00:00:46.341 --> 00:00:47.002
asked Vinnie.

9
00:00:47.022 --> 00:00:51.665
"I hope he doesn't get in trouble," said Mandy.

10
00:00:53.025 --> 00:00:56.988
As they walked up to the house, the children heard metal clanging.

11
00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.323
The noise was coming from the other side of the house.

12
00:01:01.343 --> 00:01:04.966
"Let's have a look," said Vinnie.

13
00:01:06.987 --> 00:01:09.269
Sighing loudly, Mandy followed.

14
00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:15.254
The children came to a courtyard filled with samurai, old and young.

15
00:01:16.495 --> 00:01:19.057
Some were teaching; others were training.

16
00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:22.780
A few samurai practiced with swords.

17
00:01:24.162 --> 00:01:26.804
Another group was learning to use a bow and arrow.

18
00:01:28.172 --> 00:01:28.993
"There you are!"

19
00:01:29.433 --> 00:01:31.094
a familiar voice called out.

20
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:33.235
It was Haruki.

21
00:01:33.255 --> 00:01:35.577
"I was looking everywhere for you."

22
00:01:35.597 --> 00:01:39.839
"We're sorry," the children apologized.

23
00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.022
Mandy explained what happened.

24
00:01:44.703 --> 00:01:49.526
Haruki bowed his head and said, "Thank you for coming back.

25
00:01:49.966 --> 00:01:52.988
Daimyo Masamune would have been very angry with me."

26
00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:58.482
The samurai suddenly stopped their training at the sound of horses.

27
00:01:59.982 --> 00:02:02.343
Daimyo Masamune had returned home.

28
00:02:02.363 --> 00:02:06.445
"Haruki, did you take good care of our guests?"

29
00:02:07.846 --> 00:02:09.306
he asked, approaching them.

30
00:02:10.487 --> 00:02:11.787
Haruki bowed his head.

31
00:02:11.807 --> 00:02:18.130
"We were watching the samurai training," said Vinnie enthusiastically.

32
00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:23.252
Daimyo Masamune motioned for Vinnie and Mandy to follow him.

33
00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:28.503
"A samurai's training is not only about weapons," he said.

34
00:02:29.745 --> 00:02:33.528
He took them to a smaller courtyard full of red maple trees.

35
00:02:33.548 --> 00:02:37.151
"It's beautiful!"

36
00:02:37.711 --> 00:02:38.612
cried Mandy.

37
00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:44.517
Then Daimyo Masamune led them into a room next to the courtyard.

38
00:02:44.537 --> 00:02:47.820
"Isn't this in the photo?"

39
00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:48.941
asked Vinnie.

40
00:02:50.062 --> 00:02:52.284
He took out the photo and looked at it.

41
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.922
Daimyo Masamune stood in front of a vase on a small table.

42
00:02:59.263 --> 00:03:02.585
In the vase were three stems that formed a triangle.

43
00:03:02.965 --> 00:03:03.986
Two were flowers.

44
00:03:05.406 --> 00:03:08.428
He gently picked up a flower lying on the table.

45
00:03:08.448 --> 00:03:15.212
"A true warrior must have perfect control," he said, putting the flower in the vase.

46
00:03:16.452 --> 00:03:18.353
"We must have peace in our heart."

47
00:03:19.994 --> 00:03:23.016
Then Daimyo Masamune picked up a pine stem.

48
00:03:24.864 --> 00:03:27.426
"Mandy, the photo is glowing blue!"

49
00:03:27.967 --> 00:03:28.847
Vinnie whispered.

50
00:03:30.229 --> 00:03:33.992
Daimyo Masamune's flower arrangement was very lovely.

51
00:03:35.353 --> 00:03:40.337
He pointed to one flower and said, "This stands for the sacred mountain."

52
00:03:41.618 --> 00:03:45.101
Pointing to another, he said, "And this is the river."

53
00:03:46.642 --> 00:03:49.324
Then he pointed to a white flower in the middle.

54
00:03:49.344 --> 00:03:54.008
"And this is the mist that unites the river and the mountain.

55
00:03:54.472 --> 00:03:55.613
Nature is one."

56
00:03:56.993 --> 00:03:59.214
Daimyo Masamune closed his eyes.

57
00:04:00.414 --> 00:04:03.155
The flower arrangement in the photo glowed red.

58
00:04:03.175 --> 00:04:08.818
"We're going home," whispered Vinnie, grabbing his sister's hand.

59
00:04:11.659 --> 00:04:15.120
The children fell down the tunnel and were back in the attic.
